---
.title = "The 45 Minute 'Long-Lived' Feature Branch",
.description = "How AI-assisted delivery makes shared context and trunk-based development more important, not less.",
.date = .date("2026-08-13T00:00:00"),
.authors = ["Ben O'Mahony"],
.tags = ["agentic-engineering", "engineering-practices"],
.layout = "post.shtml",
